1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,595
In this lesson, we'll work through your
Launchpad, the setup checklist in Kyntlo.

2
00:00:05,595 --> 00:00:09,054
In about 15 minutes, your
Google profile, social pages,

3
00:00:09,054 --> 00:00:13,079
website chat and phone will all
be feeding leads into one place.

4
00:00:13,937 --> 00:00:16,505
Click Launchpad near
the top of the sidebar.

5
00:00:16,505 --> 00:00:20,590
Each step connects one of the places
your customers already reach you.

6
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:24,733
Your progress is tracked at the top,
so you can always see what's left.

7
00:00:25,583 --> 00:00:27,020
Let's start with Google.

8
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:31,751
Connecting your Google Business Profile
brings your Google reviews and messages

9
00:00:31,751 --> 00:00:34,925
into Kyntlo, so you can
reply without switching apps.

10
00:00:34,925 --> 00:00:39,237
Click Connect, then choose the Google
account that manages your listing.

11
00:00:40,088 --> 00:00:42,051
Google asks you to allow access.

12
00:00:42,051 --> 00:00:45,486
Click Allow, then pick the
business location to connect.

13
00:00:45,486 --> 00:00:48,124
If you have more than
one practice or shop,

14
00:00:48,124 --> 00:00:50,639
choose the one that matches this account.

15
00:00:51,492 --> 00:00:53,441
Next, Facebook and Instagram.

16
00:00:53,441 --> 00:00:58,884
Connect the Facebook page for your business,
and tick your Instagram account too.

17
00:00:58,884 --> 00:01:03,723
Instagram needs to be a business or
creator account linked to that page.

18
00:01:03,723 --> 00:01:09,099
Once it's connected, Messenger and Instagram
messages land in your Conversations

19
00:01:09,099 --> 00:01:09,503
inbox.

20
00:01:10,352 --> 00:01:11,612
Now the chat widget.

21
00:01:11,612 --> 00:01:14,384
It adds a small chat
bubble to your website,

22
00:01:14,384 --> 00:01:19,613
and every message goes straight to your
inbox, with the visitor saved as a contact.

23
00:01:19,613 --> 00:01:20,495
Click Install.

24
00:01:20,495 --> 00:01:24,463
You can copy the code yourself,
email it to your web developer,

25
00:01:24,463 --> 00:01:26,227
or use the WordPress plugin.

26
00:01:27,078 --> 00:01:31,759
The code goes just before the closing
body tag on every page of your site.

27
00:01:31,759 --> 00:01:35,870
Copy it, add it to your website,
then mark the step as installed.

28
00:01:35,870 --> 00:01:39,412
We'll style the widget and
test it properly in Module 4.

29
00:01:40,261 --> 00:01:43,959
Set up your email takes you
to Email Services in Settings.

30
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:46,891
This is where you add
your own sending domain,

31
00:01:46,891 --> 00:01:51,418
so your emails come from your business
and land in the inbox, not spam.

32
00:01:51,418 --> 00:01:54,414
It needs a few changes
at your domain provider,

33
00:01:54,414 --> 00:01:57,028
so we give it a full lesson in Module 14.

34
00:01:57,877 --> 00:02:01,169
Get a business phone number
opens the Phone System.

35
00:02:01,169 --> 00:02:05,815
A Kyntlo number lets you call and
text customers from one shared number,

36
00:02:05,815 --> 00:02:09,559
with every call and message
saved on the contact's record.

37
00:02:09,559 --> 00:02:13,689
Buying a number and registering
it is also covered in Module 14.

38
00:02:14,540 --> 00:02:17,458
And look at that: three of
the five steps are done.

39
00:02:17,458 --> 00:02:22,208
Email and phone are still open, and they'll
stay on your checklist until you finish

40
00:02:22,208 --> 00:02:24,039
them, so nothing gets forgotten.

41
00:02:24,892 --> 00:02:25,939
Here's a pro tip.

42
00:02:25,939 --> 00:02:30,188
Always connect Google and Facebook
with an account the business owns,

43
00:02:30,188 --> 00:02:32,343
not a team member's personal login.

44
00:02:32,343 --> 00:02:36,468
If that person ever leaves, your
reviews and messages keep flowing.

45
00:02:37,353 --> 00:02:38,071
Great work!

46
00:02:38,071 --> 00:02:42,119
Next, we'll fill in your business
profile: your logo, address,

47
00:02:42,119 --> 00:02:43,946
time zone and legal details.

48
00:02:43,946 --> 00:02:45,709
See you in the next lesson.
